[dispensing_by_facility] Dispensing by Facility — Dispensing totals compared across all facilities — KISUMU, KAKAMEGA, LODWAR, TENRI. Use when asked to compare hospitals, see which facility dispenses more, or get a multi-site dispensing breakdown.
[dispensing_financials] Dispensing Financials — Financial summary of dispensing — total line cost, dispensing event total, unit price, and discounts applied. Use when asked about pharmacy revenue, cost of drugs dispensed, average drug price, total dispensing spend, or dispensing discounts.
[dispensing_stockouts] Dispensing Stockouts — Dispense events where stock hit zero (is_stockout_dispense = true). Use when asked about stockouts, drug shortages, out-of-stock events, or how often dispensing caused a stockout.
[dispensing_negative_stock] Dispensing from Negative Stock — Dispenses made when stock was already negative before the dispense (dispensed_from_negative_stock = true). More severe than a regular stockout — indicates IOUs to patients or data entry issues. Use when asked about negative stock dispensing, critical stock issues, or dispensing programme alerts.
[stockout_vs_normal_dispensing] Stockout vs Normal Dispensing Comparison — Side-by-side count of stockout dispenses versus normal dispenses, by facility and month. Use when asked about the stockout rate, proportion of dispenses that caused stockouts, or stockout trend over time.
[invoice_count] Invoice Count and Payable Amount — Total number of invoices and total payable amount. Use when asked about invoice volumes, number of bills raised, billing activity, total invoiced amounts, or financial billing summary.
[invoices_by_type] Invoices by Type/Status — Invoice count and payable amount broken down by type status. Use when asked about invoice breakdown by type, billing categories, or invoice type analysis.
[invoices_by_patient] Invoices by Patient — Invoice records with patient name and number. Use when asked about patient billing, which patients have invoices, or patient-level invoice lookup.
